{"id":"en_adored-little-treasure","title":"Adored Little Treasure","titleEn":"Adored Little Treasure","description":"Pei Yanxi, an heiress, goes against her family’s long-standing feud by secretly running away with a sworn enemy, and before long she is expecting a child. After a tragic accident and a series of misunderstandings, her baby daughter Fu Bao ends up being raised by a harsh man who becomes her unexpected guardian. Kept unaware of her real background, Fu Bao suffers years of mistreatment and constant torment, until her uncles finally discover the truth about her identity, paving the way for a striking turn in her fortunes.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/adored-little-treasure/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/adored-little-treasure/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Group Pampering","Identity Twist","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_adored-little-treasure_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_adored-little-treasure_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_adored-little-treasure_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_adored-little-treasure_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloa